{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Mines of White Label</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With the guidance of your trusty mentors and a sturdy hammer, build an empire by selling pre made companies to aspiring entrepreneurs and financial tycoons. Each client will have different needs for a fully functioning company so use your business sense to make a product fit for purpose. Don't let bankruptcy get in the way.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2792840/extras/e4973539e4c3156689496b815a1e6a6d.avif?t=1772506664\" width=808 height=168 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2792840/extras/e8ec5cc2f036e307f10c1f0badde181b.poster.avif?t=1772506664\" width=1170 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2792840/extras/e8ec5cc2f036e307f10c1f0badde181b.webm?t=1772506664\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2792840/extras/e8ec5cc2f036e307f10c1f0badde181b.mp4?t=1772506664\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ya know, a hammer can be used for more than just nails. Defeat your enemies, construct mines and fill out paperwork all with a single swing.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2792840/extras/55a56238dfee93d5cca7c799915794e6.avif?t=1772506664\" width=808 height=176 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2792840/extras/33fc57f9e8ba48b510d5479ef02b9bf8.poster.avif?t=1772506664\" width=1170 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2792840/extras/33fc57f9e8ba48b510d5479ef02b9bf8.webm?t=1772506664\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2792840/extras/33fc57f9e8ba48b510d5479ef02b9bf8.mp4?t=1772506664\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your mine will have plenty of paperwork to fill out, just like any business. So don't forget to pay your dwarfs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2792840/extras/917f8ec7ebe0544de9f1c47265fe27ee.avif?t=1772506664\" width=808 height=184 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2792840/extras/ec405a2062da785a6c19b73c9c4ca011.poster.avif?t=1772506664\" width=1170 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2792840/extras/ec405a2062da785a6c19b73c9c4ca011.webm?t=1772506664\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2792840/extras/ec405a2062da785a6c19b73c9c4ca011.mp4?t=1772506664\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once you have build up a mine to rival no other, sell it. Start again. Nothing is more satisfying than doing the same thing again.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is more to work than just life, so why not work on finding ways to get an edge for your\u00a0business. Find out about the history of your town, unlock new items, and increase your business acumen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span 